{"id":"e50a8de53c1c402a9c5d8699ea5aa3ba","owner":"abs_aus_digitalatlas","ownerId":"dabfc840be37463dac8f4f5fcaac09ce","orgId":"ypkPEy1AmwPKGNNv","created":1744258655000,"modified":1763939954000,"guid":null,"name":"","title":"ABS Australian population grid 2024","type":"Image Service","typeKeywords":["ArcGIS API for JavaScript","ArcGIS Server","Data","Image Service","Metadata","Service","Tiled Imagery"],"description":"<p style='margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:1.5rem; font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px;'>The Australian population grid 2024 was created using 2024 Estimated Resident Population (ERP) by <a href='https://www.abs.gov.au/statistics/standards/australian-statistical-geography-standard-asgs-edition-3/jul2021-jun2026/main-structure-and-greater-capital-city-statistical-areas/statistical-area-level-1' style='color:rgb(0, 97, 155); text-decoration-line:none; font-family:inherit;' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Statistical Area Level 1 2021<\/a> (SA1) data. This data was modelled to 1 kilometre square grid cells to represent the population density of Australia (people per square kilometre). This is modelled data and should be used and interpreted with caution.<\/p><p style='margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:1.5rem; font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px;'>SA1s are defined by the <a href='https://www.abs.gov.au/statistics/standards/australian-statistical-geography-standard-asgs-edition-3/jul2021-jun2026' style='color:rgb(0, 97, 155); text-decoration-line:none; font-family:inherit;' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Australian Statistical Geography Standard (ASGS) Edition 3 2021<\/a>. The grid was constructed using the National Nested Grid Standard.<\/p><p style='margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px;'><\/p><p style='margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:1.5rem; font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px;'><strong>Processing steps:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>A subset of the <a href='https://www.abs.gov.au/statistics/research/abs-address-register-users-guide' style='color:rgb(0, 97, 155); text-decoration-line:none; font-family:inherit;' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'><u>ABS Address Register<\/u><\/a> (AR) was created to represent residential addresses as closely as possible. Indigenous Community Points (ICP) were included where no AR point existed. SA1 centroid points were included where no AR or ICP point existed within an SA1. All these layers were combined into a single point layer (Allpoints).<\/li><li>The Allpoints layer was overlaid with the SA1 boundaries to give every point an SA1 code. Points without an SA1 code (outside all SA1 regions) were dropped.<\/li><li>ERP by SA1 was averaged across all points within each SA1. Points were converted to raster using the <a href='https://www.anzlic.gov.au/resources/national-nested-grid' style='color:rgb(0, 97, 155); text-decoration-line:none; font-family:inherit;' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'><u>National Nested Grid<\/u><\/a> as template. Point population values which fell within each raster cell were summed.<\/li><\/ul><p style='margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px;'><\/p><p style='margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:1.5rem; font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px;'><strong>Data and geography references<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Main source data publication: <a href='https://www.abs.gov.au/statistics/people/population/regional-population/2023-24' style='color:rgb(0, 97, 155); text-decoration-line:none; font-family:inherit;' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Regional population, 2023\u201324 financial year<\/a><\/li><li>Geographic boundary information: <a href='https://www.abs.gov.au/statistics/standards/australian-statistical-geography-standard-asgs-edition-3/jul2021-jun2026' style='color:rgb(0, 97, 155); text-decoration-line:none; font-family:inherit;' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Australian Statistical Geography Standard (ASGS) Edition 3<\/a><\/li><li>Further information: <a href='https://www.abs.gov.au/methodologies/regional-population-methodology/2023-24' style='color:rgb(0, 97, 155); text-decoration-line:none; font-family:inherit;' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Regional population methodology<\/a><\/li><li>Source: <a href='https://www.abs.gov.au/' style='color:rgb(0, 97, 155); text-decoration-line:none; font-family:inherit;' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Australian Bureau of Statistics (ABS)<\/a><\/li><\/ul><p style='margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:1.5rem; font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px;'><strong>Contact the Australian Bureau of Statistics<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Email <a href='mailto:geography@abs.gov.au' style='color:rgb(0, 97, 155); text-decoration-line:none; font-family:inherit;' rel='nofollow ugc'>geography@abs.gov.au <\/a>if you have any questions or feedback about this web service.<\/li><li><a href='https://www.subscribe.abs.gov.au/geospatialnews' style='color:rgb(0, 97, 155); text-decoration-line:none; font-family:inherit;' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Subscribe <\/a>to get updates on ABS web services and geospatial products.<\/li><\/ul><p style='margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:1.5rem; font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px;'><strong>Privacy at the Australian Bureau of Statistics<\/strong><br />Read how the ABS manages personal information - <a href='https://www.abs.gov.au/about/legislation-and-policy/privacy/privacy-abs' style='color:rgb(0, 97, 155); text-decoration-line:none; font-family:inherit;' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>ABS privacy policy.<\/a><\/p>","tags":["2024","ABS","Australia","Australian Bureau of Statistics","ERP","Demography","population grid","resident population"],"snippet":"A geographic representation (1 kilometre square grid) of Australia's estimated resident population in 2024.","thumbnail":"thumbnail/thumbnail.JPEG","documentation":null,"extent":[[109.73099999999629,-45.53899999999845],[159.39699999999462,-6.896999999999782]],"categories":["/Categories/People/Population","/Categories/Spatial Data Theme/Population distribution"],"spatialReference":"3577","accessInformation":"Australian Bureau of Statistics (ABS)","classification":null,"licenseInfo":"<span style='font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px;'>Copyright and creative commons of CC BY 4.0: <\/span><a href='https://www.abs.gov.au/website-privacy-copyright-and-disclaimer' style='color:rgb(0, 97, 155); text-decoration-line:none; font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px;' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Website privacy, copyright and disclaimer ABS copyright<\/a><br /><span style='font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&qu